WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:03.463
Every two-factor code came back invalid.

2
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:08.567
A user was locked out of production:

3
00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:11.867
the right password, and every code rejected.

4
00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:17.250
We checked the clock, the key and the stored secret one by one.

5
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.096
All fine, so the fault was in enrolment:

6
00:00:20.096 --> 00:00:22.943
a failed check still saved a new secret.

7
00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:25.807
Now a failed check writes nothing.

8
00:00:25.807 --> 00:00:30.276
Then a search of the built file showed production was still on the old build,

9
00:00:30.276 --> 00:00:31.321
so it was rebuilt.

10
00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:33.438
The user signed in,

11
00:00:33.438 --> 00:00:37.177
and a test harness with a negative control guards the rule.

